"We stitched a friend from scraps of thread" = 7/1.5 7/0.5 4 4 5 4/0.5 2/0.5 0/1.75 | I 4, IV 4
"And lit a lamp above my head" = 4/1.5 4/0.5 2 0 1 2/0.5 1/0.5 4/1.75 | I 4, V 4
"Now all the workshop's full of song" = 7/1.5 7/0.5 4 4 7 5/0.5 4/0.5 2/1.75 | I 4, I 4
